940
00:52:33,360 --> 00:52:35,588
거기엔 그 서로 다른 접근법들을 정확히
There's a certain design question there about how exactly you describe the different approaches.

941
00:52:35,588 --> 00:52:38,240
어떻게 기술할지에 대한
설계상의 질문이 있죠.

942
00:52:38,240 --> 00:52:40,640
쉬운 쪽은, 그걸 증명하려는 건지
반증하려는 건지 하는 거고요.
The easy one is: are you trying to prove it or disprove it?

943
00:52:40,640 --> 00:52:43,760
더 어려운 질문은, 이걸
증명하기 위해 시도해볼
The harder one would be to say, what are all the tactics you could take to prove this, and make sure you're applying sufficient breadth to exploring them.

944
00:52:43,760 --> 00:52:47,120
수 있는 전략이 다 뭐가
있는지 따져보고, 그것들을

945
