cursor.com/dwarkesh로 가보세요.
Go to cursor.com/dwarkesh to get started.

962
00:53:47,480 --> 00:53:50,520
확실히 수학 분야에서 AI는
다른 어떤 분야보다 훨씬
Obviously, AI in math is making much faster progress than everything else, and people point to the verifiability of the domain as the key reason this is happening.

963
00:53:50,520 --> 00:53:53,246
빠르게 발전하고 있고,
사람들은 이 분야의 검증

964
